{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI arrive in Kassel in the evening and am tired from the journey. Last evening, upon arrival, a young man was already here, sent by Conrector Matthias, the father of one of my Berlin students. He earnestly invited me to stay with them. I declined.\n\nIt is a polite gesture that I do not wish to rudely reject, but I am not a guest who forces himself into other people's households, especially not on a journey that takes me through various territories. I prefer to stay in the city itself, to organize my thoughts and plan the next day. There is a certain dignity in remaining independent, even when one is received kindly.\n\nI hope you and the children are well. The air here is fresher than in Berlin. I will write to you again soon.\n\nYour faithful\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221270,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":181,"prompt_tokens":272,"total_tokens":453,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-wCBf36Dccx54APcr99H4XrrpS7dpe7Pc","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":272,"prompt_ms":382.519,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.4063198529411765,"prompt_per_second":711.0757896993351,"predicted_n":181,"predicted_ms":4243.785,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.576583333333332,"predicted_per_second":42.41496682796136}}